Initial Package Version: 21.1.22
Upstream Status:         Not applied, suggested
Origin:                  XLibre (https://github.com/X11Libre/xserver/pull/1661)
Description:             This allows the xserver to be built without DRI if the
                         interface is not found. DRI in this case is mainly
                         used to load GLX swrast. This patch can be applied
                         unconditionally and only affects things in Mesa is
                         not installed, in which case GLX swrast loading
                         functionality doesn't make sense anyway.

